+## Target selection and bounded evidence
+
+The admission supplies actor33388's current Character pointer and exact
+PID/create-time, generation, null episode ownership, player, context, game-state
+witness, window, epoch and clock. C++ verifies identity before arm and after OFF
+through the existing safe-read style. The hot thunk compares only original RDX
+to that admitted pointer. It never dereferences the Character or game-state.
