+Only the first matching-pointer entry gets a fixed160B frame. Foreign entries
+increment one fixed64-bit counter and never consume that frame. Later matching
+entries increment a dropped-frame counter. There is no128 foreign-stop budget,
+debugger attachment, hardware breakpoint, thread enumeration or file I/O in
